        "input": "6\n2\n0 5\n2\n3 4\n3\n0 0 0\n3\n2 2 1\n5\n6 7 2 1 2\n9\n1000000000 1000000000 1000000000 1000000000 1000000000 1000000000 1000000000 1000000000 1000000000",
        "output": "5\n1\n0\n1\n4\n3000000000",
        "explanation": "Explanation:\nTest Case 1 : We can reduce A2A_2A2​ by 555 to get [0,0][0, 0][0,0] which is good. We could also have increased A1A_1A1​ by 555 to get [5,5][5, 5][5,5] which is also good.\nTest Case 2 : We can reduce A2A_2A2​ by 111 to get [3,3][3, 3][3,3] which is good."
      }
